OL,5,APolanski
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour wins the Holborn and St Pancras
OL,8,Fby-election, with the Greens coming in
OL,9,Fsecond - here's how the night unfolded
OL,11,FCamden Council leader Sagal Abdi-Wali -
OL,12,Fwho secured 45% of the vote - says it
OL,13,Fis an "extraordinary honour" to
OL,14,Frepresent the constituency, which has
OL,15,Fbeen Labour since it was created in
OL,16,F1983
OL,18,F"Whether you voted for me or not my
OL,19,Fcommitment to this community runs
OL,20,Fdeep," she tells those gathered at the
OL,21,Fcount
